            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Merck has recently received FDA approval for bezlotoxumab (Zinplava), as a treatment to reduce recurrence of C. diffcile in patients 18 years of age or older who are receiving antibiotic treatment for the infection and for whom there is a high risk of recurrence.</AbstractText>
